  "job_B9.6.2_20251003_115049": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00e6re ylcan stowe myl wi\u00f0 fyre w\u00e6s freomigende. \u00d0\u00e6t ofer his reliquias \u00fe\u00e6t heofonleoht ealle niht w\u00e6s ofergestond onde & scinende; & \u00fe\u00e6t \u00d0\u00e6t \u00e6t his byrigenne an lytel cniht fram lengtenadle w\u00e6s gelacnod. \u00d0\u00e6tte on Hibernia sum man fram his reliquium fram dea\u00f0es li\u00f0e w\u00e6s geh\u00e6led. \u00d0\u00e6tte for\u00f0ferdum Paulino \u00feam biscope Ithamar for him \u00e6t Hrofeceastre biscopsetle onfeng. & be wundorlicre eadmodnesse Oswines \u00fe\u00e6s cyninges, se fram Oswio w\u00e6lhreowlice w\u00e6s \u00d0\u00e6t se biscop Aidan \u00feam scypfarendum \u00feone storm towardne fores\u00e6gde, & eac him gehalgodne \u00d0\u00e6t se ylca biscop \u00fe\u00e6t togewehgene fyr \u00fe\u00e6re cynelican burghe gebiddende onweg gewende. \u00d0\u00e6tte Middelengla m\u00e6g\u00f0 under Peadan Pendan suna w\u00e6s cristen geworden. \u00d0\u00e6t Eastseaxan \u00feone rihtan Godes geleafan, \u00f0one hi gefyrn awurpon, under Sibrihte heora cyninge, \u00d0\u00e6t se ylca biscop Cedde onfonde fram \u00feam cyninge \u00c6\u00f0elwalde sume stowe mynster on to \u00d0\u00e6t Mercna m\u00e6g\u00f0, ofslegenum Pendan hyra cyninge, Cristes geleafan onfengon; & Oswio se \u00d0\u00e6t Ecbyrht se halga wer of Angelcynnes cynne acenned munuclif w\u00e6s l\u00e6dende on Hibernia. \u00d0\u00e6t, for\u00f0ferdum Tudan, Wilfri\u00f0 w\u00e6s sended on Gallia, & \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s gehadod fram \u00c6\u00f0elbyrhte & hi begen w\u00e6ron Nor",
